{"sha": "52bc904a870c4ddd0f1b229c3526344e1561ba8f6aab677b76ba15ccf37830ca", "body": ["\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:subtraction:2}", "倒着数，算一算：$9 - 3$；\\quad $12 - 2$；\\quad", "$15 - 4$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:subtraction:3}", "向上数，求差：$11 - 8$；\\quad $13 - 9$；\\quad", "$16 - 12$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:subtraction:4}", "写出由数 $2$、$6$、$8$ 组成的四个算式。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:subtraction:5}", "算一算，再用对应的加法检验：$14 - 6$；\\quad", "$17 - 9$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:subtraction:6}", "填一填，使等式成立：", "\\[", "10 - \\;?\\; = 7, \\qquad", "\\;?\\; - 5 = 5, \\qquad", "12 - \\;?\\; = 12 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:subtraction:7}", "“碗里有 $15$ 个樱桃。孩子们吃了 $8$ 个。", "还剩多少个？”写出减法算式和答句。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:subtraction:8}", "每个故事选择 $+$ 或 $-$，再计算：“池塘里有 $9$ 只鸭子，", "$5$ 只游走了”；“$9$ 只鸭子，$5$ 只鹅飞来了”；", "“阿里 $9$ 岁，他的姐姐 $5$ 岁：阿里比姐姐大几岁？”。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:subtraction:9}", "鸭妈妈有 $12$ 个蛋。有些孵化了；现在还剩 $12 - ?$ 个蛋，", "她数到 $7$ 个没有孵化的蛋。孵化了多少个蛋？（这属于哪一组", "算式？）", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}